  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi, I'd like to propose a new feature to be added to the \"Avatar Culling\" section, as an alternative/replacement, at the user's discretion, of the \"Hide Beyond\" feature. The new feature would allow for the display of impostor/fallback avatars for all participants in the instance, excluding those who are fully visible using the \"hide except the nearest\" feature. The request for this new feature stems from the fact that there is less performance lag when switching from fallback/impostors to a fully visible avatar compared to \"crystals/robots.\" Thank you in advance for your time, and best of luck to everyone.",
